  https://github.com/choldy/nano-cortex-web-editor
  Licence: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 Nano Cortex Web Editor Contributors

Adapted material: the Web Bluetooth connect flow (service/characteristic
discovery for C304/C305), the c304 command frames (metadata dump request,
current-state dump request, preset-change acknowledgement, FX-block / gate
bypass frames), the c305 multi-packet stream detection and reassembly rules,
the hand-rolled protobuf wire-format walker, the metadata / current-state
field maps, and the FX model catalogue (model ID → name / category,
`src/protocol/models.ts`). Reimplemented in TypeScript in `src/transport/ble.ts`,
`src/protocol/frames.ts`, `src/protocol/reassembly.ts`, `src/protocol/proto.ts`
and `src/protocol/decode.ts`.

