deskop-nano-cortex (Desktop Nano Cortex)
  https://github.com/rixrix/deskop-nano-cortex
  Licence: Apache License 2.0

Used as the protocol specification: `docs/specs/110-backend-midi-ble/spec.md`
and `design.md` (GATT UUIDs, frame layouts, field maps, reassembly rules,
transport robustness rules). The real firmware-2.2.1 current-state dump capture
and the hardware-captured live-event fixtures in `src/fixtures/captures.ts`
are reproduced from that project's unit tests
(`backend/src/infrastructure/midi/ble_schema.rs`,
`frontend/src/features/midi/protocolLabDecoder.test.ts`). The footswitch
preset-select event shape (`C0 08 01 20 <preset> 28 <IA> 30 <IB> 38 <IIA>
40 <IIB>`) follows that project's `protocolLabDecoder.ts`. No Rust code was
copied.

